WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.500
You have not signed in to anything yet.

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:10.600
Most tools want an account before they show you anything.

3
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:16.600
One report a day without an account.

4
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:22.600
The whole report. Nothing held back, nothing stamped across it.

5
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:28.600
An account gets you one an hour, and keeps your history.

6
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:34.600
You only sign up when you want the second report, not before.

7
00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:40.600
A dollar a month gets you five an hour.

8
00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:46.900
The same report at every level. You pay for how often, never for how much.

9
00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:50.900
Other ways to start is last.
